machine-monitor · ws-01   1 Dashboard  2 Device  3 Processes  6 Alerts       ?/q
1   dashboard    ↑/k  up           /   filter processes                         
2   device       ↓/j  down         s   sort column                              
3   processes    pgup page up      r   reverse sort                             
6   alerts       pgdn page down    esc clear filter / close help                
tab next view    g    top                                                       
?   help         G    bottom                                                    
q   quit                                                                        
                                                                                
                                                                                
                                                                                
                                                                                
                                                                                
                                                                                
                                                                                
                                                                                
                                                                                
                                                                                
                                                                                
                                                                                
                                                                                
                                                                                
                                                                                
